{"id":"input-fe9ec65f5363","steamAppId":"3244220","name":"A Game About Digging A Hole™","imageUrl":"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/69ab961110a2dde302c6b3282a2d99f65b6a26b9/library_600x900.jpg","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3244220/","genres":["Adventure","Indie"],"platforms":["windows"],"controllerSupport":"full","playerModes":{"singlePlayer":true,"multiplayer":false,"coop":false,"localCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"onlineCoop":false,"maximumPlayers":null},"storage":{"windowsMinimumGB":null,"windowsMinimumDisplay":null},"verificationStatus":"identified","sourceProfile":{"shortDescription":"A minimalist game about digging a hole in the garden of a newly purchased house. Collect resources, sell them, upgrade your equipment and discover a mysterious secret. Costs you only one coffee!","developers":["DoubleBee"]},"content":{"status":"success","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:56:49.888913+00:00","identityStatus":"verified","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","shortDescription":"A minimalist game about digging a hole in the garden of a newly purchased house. Collect resources, sell them, upgrade your equipment and discover a mysterious secret. Costs you only one coffee!","detailedDescription":"Hey Steam community 👋,\nI'm Ben, and I created this game in my spare time!\n\nDig deep, sell what you find, update your equipment to continue your journey further and further. With every spadeful you dig, you get closer to the truth. There's no rush, no rules - just you and the adventure underground.\n\nCosts as much as a ☕ coffee, but is fun for longer and is caffeine-free!"},"vi":{"status":"translated","shortDescription":"Một trò chơi tối thiểu về việc đào một cái lỗ trong vườn của một căn nhà mới mua. Thu thập tài nguyên, bán chúng, nâng cấp thiết bị của bạn và khám phá một bí mật bí mật. Chỉ tốn một ly cà phê thôi!","detailedDescription":"Này, cộng đồng Steam. Tôi là Ben, và tôi đã tạo ra trò chơi này trong thời gian rảnh!\nĐào sâu, bán những gì bạn tìm được, cập nhật thiết bị để tiếp tục cuộc hành trình của bạn. Với mỗi lần đào bới, bạn lại gần sự thật hơn. Không có vội vã, không có luật lệ, chỉ có anh và cuộc phiêu lưu dưới lòng đất.\nChi phí cũng nhiều như cà phê U-phê, nhưng sẽ vui hơn và không có cà-phê!"}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/header.jpg?t=1790868155"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/16fb91171fecc9d2929e534af307038db2a8e319/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1790868155"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/ss_8fe9632895a936e63746613233f1db842ff415ba.600x338.jpg?t=1790868155","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/ss_8fe9632895a936e63746613233f1db842ff415ba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790868155"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/ss_4bbd39966681492c9f394e6e587e68c798228b24.600x338.jpg?t=1790868155","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/ss_4bbd39966681492c9f394e6e587e68c798228b24.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790868155"},{"id":2,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/ss_43ff452e83067cc04aaebdfb6b48731f5f9e3cba.600x338.jpg?t=1790868155","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/ss_43ff452e83067cc04aaebdfb6b48731f5f9e3cba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790868155"},{"id":3,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/ss_508747032809f95ff6c11dc8d90512375d83a114.600x338.jpg?t=1790868155","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244220/ss_508747032809f95ff6c11dc8d90512375d83a114.1920x1080.jpg?t=1790868155"},{"id":4,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor